   "body": "Other problem which I do not know how to solve is marketing. I do not have clout in VB community, and made fix because it affects me. and because VB syntax works mostly out of the box, people would not even look for other alternatives. So I do not expect that my small change would be hugely important. Also consider that people who work with VS Code tolerate these small errors much better then IDE users because they have lower expectations to VS code.",
